    "English" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "English"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "English"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every EV traction battery is a stack of cells. This car's BMS — Battery Management System — exposes up to 192 cells in six blocks of 32. Each cell is about 3.7 V nominal; the BMS measures voltage and temperature, and balances the cells. The app colours each cell by how far it sits below the strongest cell. A 10–30 mV spread is normal; a growing gap can indicate a weak cell." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Всяка тягова батерия на EV е стек от клетки. BMS (Battery Management System) на тази кола показва до 192 клетки в шест блока по 32. Всяка клетка е около 3.7 V номинално; BMS измерва напрежение и температура и балансира клетките. Приложението оцветява всяка клетка според това колко е под най-силната. Разброс 10–30 mV е нормален; растящата разлика може да означава слаба клетка."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every EV traction battery is a stack of cells. This car's BMS — Battery Management System — exposes up to 192 cells in six blocks of 32. Each cell is about 3.7 V nominal; the BMS measures voltage and temperature, and balances the cells. The app colours each cell by how far it sits below the strongest cell. A 10–30 mV spread is normal; a growing gap can indicate a weak cell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
