      }
    },
    "The 800 V traction battery is the whole high-voltage pack. It stores the energy that moves the car." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "800V тяговата батерия е целият високоволтов пакет. Тя съхранява енергията, която движи колата."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The 800 V traction battery is the whole high-voltage pack. It stores the energy that moves the car."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Battery Management System measures voltage, current and temperature, estimates SoC/SoH, and protects the pack. Everything in this app is read-only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Battery Management System измерва напрежение, ток и температура, оценява SoC/SoH и защитава пакета. Всичко в приложението е само за четене."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Battery Management System measures voltage, current and temperature, estimates SoC/SoH, and protects the pack. Everything in this app is read-only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pack is divided into modules. Each module contains a group of cells and its own sensing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пакетът е разделен на модули. Всеки модул съдържа група клетки и собствени сензори."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The pack is divided into modules. Each module contains a group of cells and its own sensing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a separate lead-acid/AGM auxiliary battery that powers the car's electronics. The LDC (low-voltage DC-DC converter) charges it from the HV pack." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Това е отделна оловно-киселинна/AGM спомагателна батерия, която захранва електрониката. LDC (нисковолтов DC-DC преобразувател) я зарежда от HV пакета."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is a separate lead-acid/AGM auxiliary battery that powers the car's electronics. The LDC (low-voltage DC-DC converter) charges it from the HV pack."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the conventional 12 V auxiliary battery (lead-acid/AGM), not the traction battery. The LDC — low-voltage DC-DC converter — charges it from the high-voltage pack." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Това е обикновената 12V спомагателна батерия (акумулатор), а не тяговата батерия. LDC — нисковолтов DC-DC преобразувател — я зарежда от високоволтовия пакет."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is the conventional 12 V auxiliary battery (lead-acid/AGM), not the traction battery. The LDC — low-voltage DC-DC converter — charges it from the high-voltage pack."
          }
        }
      }
    },
