    "Battery, cell and diagnostic results are estimates built from manufacturer-specific data that has not been validated against your car. They are not a substitute for a service inspection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Battery, cell and diagnostic results are estimates built from manufacturer-specific data that has not been validated against your car. They are not a substitute for a service inspection."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Резултатите за батерията, клетките и диагностиката са приблизителни оценки, изградени от данни на производителя, които не са проверени спрямо вашия автомобил. Те не заместват сервизен преглед."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not while driving" : {
